-training"&gt;Separate inference from training&lt;a href="#separate-inference-from-training" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="Link to this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;SageAttention3 targets &lt;strong&gt;FP4 inference&lt;/strong&gt;; SageBwd targets &lt;strong&gt;INT8 training&lt;/strong&gt;. Of seven forward/backward matmuls, $dOV^\top$ stays FP16. (§3–4)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>